{"counts": {"Open": 1, "OpenHigh": 0, "OpenMedium": 0, "OpenLow": 1, "Resolved": 3, "Dismissed": 0, "Stale": 2}, "findings": [{"id": "01M3F665FFXC2980ERDDJFFNA8", "trailId": "01M35QPB9MKEP3AJ4G6T0C2PXD", "repositoryId": "01KWZ6252FA5XEMQJYDQ5ZX6RQ", "reviewId": "01M3F665F8141ZTP6GPB0EYQGY", "codeVersionId": "01M3F641WCBCBF1DPCF9VHJPA8", "actorId": "agent:trail-review", "title": null, "body": "The entry that triggers eviction is lost: `LoadOrStore` inserts the verdict, but when `Add(1)` crosses `semanticIntegrityMemoMaxEntries`, the subsequent `Clear()` evicts it. The next query for this key will re-validate unnecessarily. Consider re-inserting the current key-verdict pair after clearing, or store before incrementing the count.", "severity": "low", "confidence": 0.85, "status": "open", "statusReason": null, "staleOutcome": "current", "staleCheckedAt": null, "staleCheckedCodeVersionId": null, "clientId": "3af2ae0e235d4e4f199323ed10f03fe4", "clientIdHash": "a66b283f9e67fd9405b2c4a9b31f7a6bae1d6ab696f1f4d31704ba91a177bd21", "createdAt": "2026-09-26T15:43:50.767Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-26T15:43:50.767Z", "location": {"id": "01M3F665FFGKDZNBMM077YXCYY", "reviewCommentId": "01M3F665FFXC2980ERDDJFFNA8", "codeVersionId": "01M3F641WCBCBF1DPCF9VHJPA8", "granularity": "range", "filePath": "internal/cli/semantic.go", "startLine": 7388, "startColumn": null, "endLine": 7391, "endColumn": null, "selectedText": "	if semanticIntegrityMemoCount.Add(1) > semanticIntegrityMemoMaxEntries {
		semanticIntegrityMemo.Clear()
		semanticIntegrityMemoCount.Store(0)
	}", "nearbyText": null, "language": null}, "discussionId": "01M3F665FF0F78RDQTND3EK56K"}], "has_more": false, "trail": {"id": "01M35QPB9MKEP3AJ4G6T0C2PXD", "number": 236, "branch": "perf/verify-once-per-generation", "originalBranch": "perf/verify-once-per-generation", "base": "main", "title": "perf(semantic): verify a generation once per file version, not once per query", "status": "open", "phase": "reviewing", "author": {"id": "01KSK3QAE64QAADZ4Z86DY4771", "login": "suhaanthayyil"}, "assignees": ["suhaanthayyil"], "priority": "none", "type": "task", "createdAt": "2026-09-22T23:37:22.485Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-26T15:43:50.767Z", "unresolvedCount": 1, "bodyDocument": {"textSnapshot": "Problem: Semantic integrity checks (snapshot and SQLite store validation) were re-run for every query in a single process, even when the underlying files had not changed. On a 747k-line repository, these checks are expensive: ~436 ms per store validation, ~164 ms per snapshot validation—totaling roughly half of a 1.2 s search. A process issuing several searches paid this cost redundantly.
Solution: Added a thread-safe in-process memo cache keyed by file path, manifest declaration values, and file identity (size + mtime fingerprint). Verification results are cached per file version; if a file changes on disk, the identity changes and the file is re-verified. The first search in a process always performs the checks (no CLI-invocation impact); subsequent searches within the same process reuse the verdict. Includes tests to ensure the cache never softens a verdict, keys correctly on all input dimensions, and detects file corruption.", "etag": "W/"2026-09-22T23:37:59.935798Z""}}}

